{"4078040": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Violet Mind and The Mysterious Island", "steam_appid": 4078040, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4674780], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Violet Mind and The Mysterious Island</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Estimated Playtime: ~15 hours</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bosses: 30+ epic encounters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of Violet Mind, a unicorn gifted with powerful elemental magic and now trapped with his friends inside a strange pocket world beyond reality. What began as a curious portal leads to a dark, gruesome and twisting island filled with secrets, abandoned places and caring Leader that will help you with your and other ponies escape</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To escape, Violet must uncover the truth behind the island’s creation — and the hidden forces that keep it sealed away. But not everything is as it seems...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced Combat:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face over 30 unique bosses that test your reflexes, magic mastery, and creativity. Every fight pushes your skill to its limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078040/extras/4286da2a4e3ef82c82ef65933943b68a.poster.avif?t=1778183232\" width=746 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078040/extras/4286da2a4e3ef82c82ef65933943b68a.webm?t=1778183232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078040/extras/4286da2a4e3ef82c82ef65933943b68a.mp4?t=1778183232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Metroidvania Exploration:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a vast interconnected world full of secrets, shortcuts, and mysteries. New powers unlock new paths and hidden truths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078040/extras/41e7554a69ca0524f4d903f83cac9103.poster.avif?t=1778183232\" width=400 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078040/extras/41e7554a69ca0524f4d903f83cac9103.webm?t=1778183232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078040/extras/41e7554a69ca0524f4d903f83cac9103.mp4?t=1778183232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elemental Magic System:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine different elemental magics to create powerful hybrid spells. Mix fire with ice, Fire with Electricity or just put all of them together! The combinations are yours to experiment with.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078040/extras/693a2bcb38ffc6395c8b3def97c2c45e.poster.avif?t=1778183232\" width=534 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078040/extras/693a2bcb38ffc6395c8b3def97c2c45e.webm?t=1778183232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078040/extras/693a2bcb38ffc6395c8b3def97c2c45e.mp4?t=1778183232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spell, Elements and Pattern Customization:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change the trajectory and behavior of your projectiles with unique magic elements and patterns. Adapt your attacks to every challenge and boss encounter.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078040/extras/545f09473a88058bf83a7245b4e7ee5c.poster.avif?t=1778183232\" width=422 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078040/extras/545f09473a88058bf83a7245b4e7ee5c.webm?t=1778183232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078040/extras/545f09473a88058bf83a7245b4e7ee5c.mp4?t=1778183232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A World Full of Secrets:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every area hides something — from hidden rooms to secret bosses, powefull upgrades and lore fragments that reveal the dark story of the island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Will You Escape the Island... or Become a Part of It?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078040/extras/d164e9d8d11b9416f285d52963e37b67.poster.avif?t=1778183232\" width=578 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078040/extras/d164e9d8d11b9416f285d52963e37b67.webm?t=1778183232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078040/extras/d164e9d8d11b9416f285d52963e37b67.mp4?t=1778183232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“Violet Mind and The Mysterious Island” blends fast-paced action, deep exploration, Horror elements, and emotional storytelling into a Metroidvania adventure that rewards curiosity and mastery.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Violet Mind and The Mysterious Island</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Estimated Playtime: ~15 hours</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bosses: 30+ epic encounters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of Violet Mind, a unicorn gifted with powerful elemental magic and now trapped with his friends inside a strange pocket world beyond reality. What began as a curious portal leads to a dark, gruesome and twisting island filled with secrets, abandoned places and caring Leader that will help you with your and other ponies escape</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To escape, Violet must uncover the truth behind the island’s creation — and the hidden forces that keep it sealed away. But not everything is as it seems...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced Combat:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face over 30 unique bosses that test your reflexes, magic mastery, and creativity. Every fight pushes your skill to its limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078040/extras/4286da2a4e3ef82c82ef65933943b68a.poster.avif?t=1778183232\" width=746 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078040/extras/4286da2a4e3ef82c82ef65933943b68a.webm?t=1778183232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078040/extras/4286da2a4e3ef82c82ef65933943b68a.mp4?t=1778183232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Metroidvania Exploration:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a vast interconnected world full of secrets, shortcuts, and mysteries. New powers unlock new paths and hidden truths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078040/extras/41e7554a69ca0524f4d903f83cac9103.poster.avif?t=1778183232\" width=400 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078040/extras/41e7554a69ca0524f4d903f83cac9103.webm?t=1778183232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078040/extras/41e7554a69ca0524f4d903f83cac9103.mp4?t=1778183232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elemental Magic System:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine different elemental magics to create powerful hybrid spells. Mix fire with ice, Fire with Electricity or just put all of them together! The combinations are yours to experiment with.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078040/extras/693a2bcb38ffc6395c8b3def97c2c45e.poster.avif?t=1778183232\" width=534 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078040/extras/693a2bcb38ffc6395c8b3def97c2c45e.webm?t=1778183232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078040/extras/693a2bcb38ffc6395c8b3def97c2c45e.mp4?t=1778183232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spell, Elements and Pattern Customization:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change the trajectory and behavior of your projectiles with unique magic elements and patterns. Adapt your attacks to every challenge and boss encounter.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.ste